    "Id": "mechdef_centurion_CN9-QSK-R2",
    "Name": "Centurion CN9-QSK-R2",
    "Details": "The Solaris Circuit, who doesn't want to test their metal and piloting skills in these high stakes, high win environments? You want to contend but can't afford a top of the line custom machine? Look no further then our new line of Gladiatorial Centurion series! Built with inspiration from ancient Terran Gladiators do these custom frames come with a bountifull mix of defences, melee weaponry and patented Quicsell weaponry of great renown and limited run. We heard our customers concerns on survivability and built these machines to take damage as good as they deal it. Feel like a hero of olden days with these marvelous melds of machine and muscle. <size=50%>All winnings earned while piloting these machines pay an exposure fee of 5% to Quicsell Industries, Solaris branch</size>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Pilot</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.04</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_centurion"
  },
